<title>ITALY: Marangoni H1 group pretax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Marangoni H1 group pretax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian tyremaker Marangoni said it posted first half 1996 group pretax profit of 7.02 billion lire against 10.48 billion in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its turnover was 3.7 percent down to 191.75 billion lire.</p>
<p>The firm, the leading Italian manufacturer of remoulded tyres and treads, said it expected better second half results.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
